If aks helm deployment fails ?? 
-------------------------------------------------------------
Helm is a package manager for k8s 
Helps to deploy and manage k8s applications using reusable charts instead of applying individual yml files 

Helm reads the charts and configuration values
Values .yml 
Chart.yml 
Templates 
Deployment.yml 
Service l.yml
Ingress.yml

To k8s  manifest files 
Helm install or upgrade the application as per our desired inputs 

I check the failure whether helm task or deployment stage then I will check helm commands release namespace, chart version , values file ..
Helm status and helm list and history to understand that Installation or upgrade failed .

After that kubectl commands 
Rbac permissions I will check
Roll back to previous successful version 

Root cause find out and documentation to avoid in further

