How do you manage 30 applications on microservices??
-----------------------------------------------------------------
For 30 applications i would follow cicd automation and used containerization and deploy to k8s 

Maintain seperate repository for each application and created cicd pipelines by yml to perform 
Build , unit testing, docker image creation , scan and pushing to acr and deploy to aks by helm charts 
For each environments dev,qa,uat,stg, production instead of multiple k8s manfiest yml files 

Security ascpets -- secrets stored in azure keyvaluts 

Latest image tag is not encourage we need to use specific tag to avoid failure and easy to roll back 

For prod deployments instead of auto approvals going with manual to avoid issues.

